          "speaker": "father"
        },
        {
          "segment_id": "note:007",
          "type": "note",
          "source_text": "That's because ✓, or \"gou\" (check mark), means correct, while ✗, or \"cha\" (cross), means incorrect. X looks a lot like ✗.",
